  "reason": "The title and abstract discuss the challenges and roadmap for translating 'omics' discoveries to clinical utility, particularly in cancer. However, it does not report any quantitative measure of agreement between non-human animal results and human clinical results. It focuses on the process and rigor required for biomarker development, not on a statistical comparison of animal model efficacy versus human clinical outcomes."
